---
description: Never show item/product count badges or counters in UI
alwaysApply: true
---

# No item counters

Do **not** display counts of items, products, stones, cards, or similar inventory in the UI (e.g. "48 stones", "12 works", "5 items").

- No count badges, meta lines, or section subheads driven by `.length` / inventory totals
- Labels and copy stay qualitative; do not announce how many things are in a shelf or grid
- Only add a counter if the user **explicitly** asks for one
